{"nodes": [{"id": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_decision", "label": "ADR 0191: Give every theme Hallmark's Console treatment: the colours kept, the type and surfaces made one system", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The user wanted a more unique, professional look with minimal UI change and the colour scheme kept. Console fits the feature set: a near-black ground with GLUE Stick's amber signal, a mono only for measured values, hairline panels with 10 px corners. Rim and Ultraviolet would change the colours or the shape."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_tokens", "label": "Shared theme tokens: --stage, --on-stage, --stage-glass, --scrim, --shadow-pop, --bad-ink", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Literal colours belong in the theme table, so every theme gets the same surfaces. The brand and field tokens live in app.css."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_type_system", "label": "Type system: Archivo titles, Host Grotesk reading, Atkinson mono for measured values", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The heavy grotesque stays for titles because it is GLUE Stick's identity. Studio, Riso and Moss keep their own faces."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_rules", "label": "Website rules: sentence-case labels, no emoji icons, no middle dots, no eyebrows, no dashes in copy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Disabled controls change fill, ink and cursor, not opacity alone. Progress bars move by transform. The homepage scroll reveal was removed because Console keeps still."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_sloplint", "label": "sloplint: Hallmark's linter that checks the treatment (kept links, fields, handlers, test hooks)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Run at restyle depth: layout, routes, words and wiring kept, the system changed. Two sticky bars still reported and left open."}], "edges": [{"source": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0028_themes_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_decision", "target": "vault_system_look", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_tokens", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_type_system", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0191-hallmark-console-treatment.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0191_hallmark_console_treatment_d